# --- Optional: Supabase (real cloud accounts + cross-device save/load) --------
#
# Leave these BLANK to use the built-in localStorage backend — the game is fully
# functional with no setup. Fill them in to switch to Supabase automatically.
#
#   1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
#   2. Project Settings -> API: copy the "Project URL" and the "anon public" key
#   3. Copy this file to .env and paste them below, then restart `npm run dev`
#   4. In the Supabase SQL editor, run docs/supabase.sql (creates the saves table)
#
# The anon key is safe to expose in a frontend — it is protected by row-level
# security (see docs/supabase.sql).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
